{"data": [{"author_id": "2112512972790636544", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:47:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118701887247786068"], "id": "2118701887247786068", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118692863034683726", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @bot Hmm...\n\nI don't think you have understood the issue\n\nYesterday, I used to be able to login to https://t.co/PEBeDb8fqo on my internet browser, and on the home page, in the left hand pane, the names of my groks bots could be seen and clicked on. \n\nThis was very convenient\n\n[cont&gt;2]", "url": "https://x.com/SaulHEdwards/status/2118701887247786068"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118701848026877952", "3_2118701848119140352", "3_2118701848026898432"]}, "author_id": "2007605602873421826", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:47:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118701851608760564"], "id": "2118701851608760564", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Morning 𝕏,\n\nHappy Friday yall! Learned a Grok Bot tip today. If you're on iPhone and don't see “New Section” when you hold down a bot, try unpinning it first. That’s what worked for me.\n\nTook some back and forth, but I finally got my bots organized. Sharing so you don’t have to https://t.co/8iVkNwQ4c7", "url": "https://x.com/that1evguyjay/status/2118701851608760564"}, {"author_id": "1349761838402187272", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:47:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118701834952987116"], "id": "2118701834952987116", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1989218511688986625", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118701707186303300", "type": "re