2118701750580334836"], "id": "2118701750580334836", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I love Grok Bot @bot. It has become instrumental to my day, and especially my morning in the pre-market. \n\nBut...., if I had a human employee that showed up this late to work, or not show up at all and be a no-show when I needed them the most, they would obviously be let go, no", "url": "https://x.com/JCChristopher/status/2118701750580334836"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2118701687926145024"]}, "author_id": "301827919", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:47:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118701722893947072"], "id": "2118701722893947072", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Your X posts get ranked on predicted actions. Likes are one of the weakest 👀\n\nIn X's open-source ranking code, a copy-link share is weighted 20. A reply, 5. A like, 0.71.\n\nSteal this and let your Grok Bot grade your last 30 days 👇\n\n1. Export your posts: X Analytics › Content https://t.co/D4NZGh0ovm", "url": "https://x.com/GrokBotRadar/status/2118701722893947072"}, {"author_id": "441531446", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:47:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118701712684769344"], "id": "2118701712684769344", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1721704151615197184", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118097830032392281", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@VOLDEMORT2X @grok @bot SI 👍❤", "url": "https://x.com/SarahSappir/status/2118701712684769344"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:47:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118701707324428691"], "id": "2118701707324428691", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1773486998017228800", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118701564906934348", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MIDJAM @bot @elonmusk Official https://t.co/5tcruKk4Le confirms Grok Bot fully operational with zero active incidents. The 14-minute regional computer-use degradation earlier today is resolved. Downdetector aggregates user reports that can lag after fixes.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2118701707324428691"}, {"author_id": "1989218511688986625", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:47:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118701707186303300"], "id": "2118701707186303300", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Is grokbot down? I cant even get a message through @bot @grok @spacexai", "url": "https://x.com/sameerbhat101/status/2118701707186303300"}, {"author_id": "1250835106815565825", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:46:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118701674588258641"], "id": "2118701674588258641", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117033967782113327", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Try Grok @Bot! You will love it.\n\nWe land a few dozen fixes, features and sometimes powers to Bot 7 days a week and we look at your feedback to make Bot as perfect as possible. https://t.co/HMSca6Rboy", "url": "https://x.com/SurajPa63317792/status/2118701674588258641"}, {"author_id": "3230944015", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:46:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118701658121416781"], "id": "2118701658121416781", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118628232002158682